Security Summary: ${JSON.stringify(context.security_summary)}

TASK: Identify the PRIMARY root cause of the pipeline failure. Look for ALL error patterns in the log above including: missing tools, expired API keys, network issues, email failures, Slack failures, test failures, Docker issues.`;

